    "created_at": "2022-05-05T19:06:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-05T19:06:09Z",
    "body": "Should we close this? Most algorithms (any with reasonably regular infinitive->gerunding conversion) are handled by Bikeshed now. Maybe we want some guidance on adding the gerund form when it's irregular? Or maybe just \"consider these X common ways algorithms are invoked, and make sure you're not horribly awkward in any of them; tooling can solve some of these automatically\"?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
